 is nigh. The humanity is standing upon the brink of a new era where modern healthcare makes tremendous scientific advancements. With the help of nanotechnologies a surgical prototype bathyscaphe allows its operator to shrink to a microlevel and travel inside the patient's body. \n\nA unique experimental project made by Nival to test the opportunities of the new Virtual Reality provided by Oculus Rift. ", "short_description": "InMind is a short adventure with arcade elements designed for the Oculus VR. Submerge into the microworld and experience the miracles of the human mind."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://en.nival.com/privacypolicy-us", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://en.nival.com/tos-us", "publisher_name": "Nival", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://inmind.nivalvr.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": null, "genres": ["EDUCATIONAL", "ADVENTURE", "CASUAL", "EXPLORATION", "RACING"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["GAMEPAD"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "240683611550502"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12138817_551259671698686_383322475_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UwLZvJmX6SwQ7kNvwE57ROD&_nc_oc=AdocN04imPAS67hHvkQM2_2T5goK56e7SBn9q-_fqhuChFjcIeQ88LB--Y7cq1NT5uc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIgG6WHkNpazu_ykiyadzrUJLV4LQIYYR5z0mT8Yb29yQ&oe=6AA6BA61"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "InMind", 